Litter Box

A simple solution to upload and share files extremely quickly with
strangers on the internet, no matter if you, or your strangers, are
using ancient browsers from the nineties.

The goal of this project is to provide a quick and super simple
solution that allows you, and only you, to upload files to a server
you control and make them available on the internet for other people.
Think of it as a public Google Drive folder that's self hosted and can
be used with ancient browsers.

hTime-based One-Time Password (TOTP)	URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_one-time_password

This project can, and by its own design and goal, should be exposed to
the public internet. All your uploads will by default be public, but
uploading new content requires the usage of a TOTP, so you are
protected against random people uploading things to your server.

